{"parentUuid":"ce9d57a4-a44a-417d-b819-bf4ac5e858d7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce5YUtHF2pBeSYe2cbPun","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4000,"cache_read_input_tokens":216493,"output_tokens":2625,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4000,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2625,"cache_read_input_tokens":216493,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4000},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce5YUrgkMMviFQ3aJ6E5p","type":"assistant","uuid":"8dc56100-9bda-4577-8eac-7a8186b19a1b","timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:16:23.357Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"fe41fb4b-5221-41ce-afce-6a9fa3dade0c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-bench-results","sessionId":"27642e0f-a981-4143-aea0-6f4f8cb34d37","version":"2.1.226","gitBranch":"main","slug":"structured-meandering-origami"}
{"parentUuid":"8dc56100-9bda-4577-8eac-7a8186b19a1b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce5YUtHF2pBeSYe2cbPun","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now the two structural changes: LongMemEval as a second-benchmark subsection, and Section XII rebuilt around the full factorial including the reversal."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4000,"cache_read_input_tokens":216493,"output_tokens":2625,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4000,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2625,"cache_read_input_tokens":216493,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4000},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce5YUrgkMMviFQ3aJ6E5p","type":"assistant","uuid":"84a76241-2463-466b-8224-db5e255fbe3f","timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:16:24.066Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"fe41fb4b-5221-41ce-afce-6a9fa3dade0c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-bench-results","sessionId":"27642e0f-a981-4143-aea0-6f4f8cb34d37","version":"2.1.226","gitBranch":"main","slug":"structured-meandering-origami"}
{"parentUuid":"84a76241-2463-466b-8224-db5e255fbe3f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce5YUtHF2pBeSYe2cbPun","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01SHwE2S6mfgzQnBPJ2CDraz","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-bench-results\npython3 - <<'PY'\ns=open(\"paper-tkde.html\").read()\n\n# ---- renumber Results subsections to make room for LME at B ----\ns = s.replace('<h3>B. Retrieval quality</h3>', '<h3>C. Retrieval quality</h3>')\ns = s.replace('<h3>C. Index construction cost</h3>', '<h3>D. Index construction cost</h3>')\ns = s.replace('<h3>D. Effect of candidate selection</h3>', '<h3>E. Effect of candidate selection</h3>')\ns = s.replace('<h3>E. An improvement we measured and rejected</h3>', '<h3>F. An improvement we measured and rejected</h3>')\ns = s.replace('the natural next step for anyone reading Section XI-E',\n              'the natural next step for anyone reading this section')\n\nLME = \"\"\"<h3>B. Second benchmark: LongMemEval</h3>\n\n<p class=\"first\">A single benchmark cannot establish generality, so we repeat the comparison on\nLongMemEval [39], 500 questions over six question types, against the same competitor under the same\nspine: identical reader, identical judge, <span class=\"mono\">top_k</span> = 200, all questions, zero\ndrops and zero empty answers in both arms.</p>\n\n<div class=\"tbl\">\n<table>\n  <caption>Table III. <span class=\"cn\">LongMemEval, 500 questions, same window</span></caption>\n  <thead><tr><th>Question type</th><th class=\"n\">n</th><th class=\"n\">eg</th><th class=\"n\">mem0</th><th class=\"n\">&Delta;</th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>Knowledge update</td><td class=\"n\">78</td><td class=\"n\">&mdash;</td><td class=\"n\">&mdash;</td><td class=\"n\">+7.69</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Multi-session</td><td class=\"n\">133</td><td class=\"n\">&mdash;</td><td class=\"n\">&mdash;</td><td class=\"n\">+4.51</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Temporal reasoning</td><td class=\"n\">133</td><td class=\"n\">&mdash;</td><td class=\"n\">&mdash;</td><td class=\"n\">0.00</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>Single-session preference</td><td class=\"n\">30</td><td class=\"n\">&mdash;</td><td class=\"n\">&mdash;</td><td class=\"n\">&minus;13.33</td></tr>\n    <tr><td><b>Overall</b></td><td class=\"n\"><b>500</b></td><td class=\"n\"><b>89.60</b></td><td class=\"n\"><b>87.40</b></td><td class=\"n\"><b>+2.20</b></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"nofirst\">The margin is 2.20 points with a discordant split of 40 to 29, bootstrap interval\n[&minus;1.00, +5.40] and <i>p</i> = 0.228. It is larger than the LoCoMo margin and, like it, does not\nreach significance. The direction is the same on both benchmarks and the magnitude is not\ndistinguishable from zero on either.</p>\n\n<p>Two controls are worth stating. First, this comparison was run <i>concurrently</i> for both arms\noff banked retrievals. We also computed the same comparison from the original cross-window runs and\nobtained an identical +2.20; serving drift, which we had expected to be the dominant threat here, was\nnot moving this particular comparison. Second, the strongest per-type cell, knowledge update at\n+7.69, is the category most directly about superseding an earlier fact with a later one, which is\nwhere an append-only extraction store is known to be weak. We note the correspondence and do not\nclaim it as a mechanism, because the single-session preference cell moves 13.33 points the other way\non 30 questions and both are far below the detectable effect at these subgroup sizes.</p>\n\n<h3>C. Retrieval quality</h3>\"\"\"\ns = s.replace('<h3>C. Retrieval quality</h3>', LME, 1)\n\n# ---- renumber later tables (old III/IV/V/VI shift by one) ----\ns = s.replace('Table III. <span class=\"cn\">Measured index construction',\n              'Table IV. <span class=\"cn\">Measured index construction')\ns = s.replace('Table IV. <span class=\"cn\">Index cost in currency',\n              'Table V. <span class=\"cn\">Index cost in currency')\ns = s.replace('Table IV instantiates the cost model', 'Table V instantiates the cost model')\ns = s.replace('Table IV reports them and the resulting', 'Table V reports them and the resulting')\n\nopen(\"paper-tkde.html\",\"w\").write(s)\nprint(\"LME section inserted; tables renumbered\")\nPY\ngrep -n \"Table III\\|Table IV\\|Table V\\|Table VI\" paper-tkde.html | head","description":"Insert LongMemEval section, renumber tables"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4000,"cache_read_input_tokens":216493,"output_tokens":2625,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4000,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2625,"cache_read_input_tokens":216493,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4000},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce5YUrgkMMviFQ3aJ6E5p","type":"assistant","uuid":"5a747a53-8328-4922-a2a1-ae2a3bd7bd7c","timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:16:42.362Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"fe41fb4b-5221-41ce-afce-6a9fa3dade0c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-bench-results","sessionId":"27642e0f-a981-4143-aea0-6f4f8cb34d37","version":"2.1.226","gitBranch":"main","slug":"structured-meandering-origami"}
{"parentUuid":"5a747a53-8328-4922-a2a1-ae2a3bd7bd7c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"22aece5c-9924-4e9e-8a41-3e39834f4322","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SHwE2S6mfgzQnBPJ2CDraz","type":"tool_result","content":"LME section inserted; tables renumbered\n527:we measure rather than estimate (methodology in Section X-C). Table V reports them and the resulting\n726:  <caption>Table III. <span class=\"cn\">LongMemEval, 500 questions, same window</span></caption>\n791:  <caption>Table IV. <span class=\"cn\">Measured index construction, full corpus (5,882 chunks)</span></caption>\n814:rates. Table V instantiates the cost model of Section VII-B across price points.</p>\n818:  <caption>Table V. <span class=\"cn\">Index cost in currency, by price point (USD / Mtok in&thinsp;/&thinsp;out)</span></caption>\n884:  <caption>Table V. <span class=\"cn\">Headline margin under reader variation</span></caption>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"0b47ad09-1af7-4c9a-a03e-827b9ddcdc3b","timestamp":"2026-08-16T01:16:42.455Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"LME section inserted; tables renumbered\n527:we measure rather than estimate (methodology in Section X-C). Table V reports them and the resulting\n726:  <caption>Table III. <span class=\"cn\">LongMemEval, 500 questions, same window</span></caption>\n791:  <caption>Table IV. <span class=\"cn\">Measured index construction, full corpus (5,882 chunks)</span></caption>\n814:rates. Table V instantiates the cost model of Section VII-B across price points.</p>\n818:  <caption>Table V. <span class=\"cn\">Index cost in currency, by price point (USD / Mtok in&thinsp;/&thinsp;out)</span></caption>\n884:  <caption>Table V. <span class=\"cn\">Headline margin under reader variation</span></caption>","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5a747a53-8328-4922-a2a1-ae2a3bd7bd7c","session_id":"fe41fb4b-5221-41ce-afce-6a9fa3dade0c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"