{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"27642e0f-a981-4143-aea0-6f4f8cb34d37","bridgeSessionId":"cse_015igKU9YpcFoeCFDccAcvXX","lastSequenceNum":16531}
{"parentUuid":"ffc4e9a3-19cd-43ae-ae6f-3a13bd1afcca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce7LgPDhd5eiD4kyQWkEg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Progress: the manuscript is done.** 12pp, 9,751 words, 43 refs, 7 tables, 7 figures — inside TKDE's 14-page limit.\n\nSince the VM went dark I closed the gap that didn't need it. The paper described a **code** index and evaluated it only on prose — a reviewer hits that immediately. Now Section VII-C carries real measurements from your four repos:\n\n| repo | kLOC | symbols | relations | build | kLOC/s |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| entire-api | 163.9 | 12,806 | 57,363 | 11.7s | 14.0 |\n| entire.io | 399.3 | 29,402 | 90,026 | 33.2s | 12.0 |\n| cli | 411.7 | 23,767 | 130,073 | 25.0s | 16.5 |\n| entiredb | 462.3 | 36,068 | 198,924 | 33.9s | 13.6 |\n| **total** | **1,437** | **102,043** | **476,386** | **103.8s** | **13.8** |\n\nTwo things fall out. **Determinism is now verified, not asserted** — I indexed each repo twice and SHA-256'd the complete record stream; byte-identical on all four. That was the paper's central claim and it had no evidence behind it. And **throughput is flat across a 2.8× size range** (12.0–16.5 kLOC/s, no downward trend), which is exactly what the `O(|C| + E log S)` analysis predicts — so the complexity section now has empirical backing too.\n\nThe line I'd put in front of a reviewer: indexing all 1.4M lines from scratch takes less wall-clock than *one* of the 5,882 extraction calls mem0 makes, and costs zero tokens.\n\n## Remaining\n\n**Needs you:** author names, affiliation, licence — placeholder is `[Author Names]`. And `! gcloud auth login` to bring the VM back.\n\n**Needs the VM:** the two BM25 controls. Worth knowing these can only weaken the paper, not strengthen it — BM25 is currently the one significant accuracy margin we have, and both tests probe whether it holds. Everything else in the paper stands without them."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":224,"cache_read_input_tokens":258556,"output_tokens":731,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":224,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":258556,"cache_creation_input_tokens":224,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":224},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce7LgGaqZiHDDebpzr829","type":"assistant","uuid":"6e97c194-df3e-4aff-8ae0-de5de8a5f22a","timestamp":"2026-08-17T00:02:46.635Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"fe41fb4b-5221-41ce-afce-6a9fa3dade0c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-bench-results","sessionId":"27642e0f-a981-4143-aea0-6f4f8cb34d37","version":"2.1.226","gitBranch":"main","slug":"structured-meandering-origami"}
