 (Certified), Google Cloud, Vercel, Railway, Docker, GitHub Actions, serverless architecture\nDatabases & Tools: ChromaDB, PostgreSQL, Redis, Firebase, Git, Weights & Biases\nSpecialized: Computer Vision, CNNs, NLP, Reinforcement Learning, Web Scraping, API Integration, Bioinformatics (Cox regression, SHAP, TCGA pipelines)\nA C T I V I T I E S & L E A D E R S H I P\n63817542202\nDirector of Coding / Programming Events, Marvin Ridge TSA (May 2026 – Present)\nInnovation Hub Co-Manager, Marvin Ridge Computer Science Club (May 2026 – Present)\nNSDA Speech & Debate — Active member, Lincoln-Douglas and Public Forum divisions (Sep 2025 – Present)\nC E R T I F I C AT I O N S & AWA R D S\n63817542338\nAWS Certified AI Practitioner — Feb 2025 – Feb 2028 (Credential: 8757c9af62694d8c9a433c0dbccc20f3)\nNSDA — 2nd Place Rising Stars PF, Capstone Tournament, Dec 2025 (5–0 prelim record, 29 avg speaker points)\nTSA — 2nd Place, NC State, Software Development (2026)\nFBLA — Top 10, NC State, Website Coding & Development (2026)\nBETA Club — 3rd Place, SC State, Computer Science Principles (2025)\nRobotics — Create Award, State Qualifying Local Competition (2026)\nA D D I T I O N A L I N F O R M AT I O N\n63817542311\nLanguages: English (Native), Hindi (Native), Spanish (Working Proficiency)\nInterests: AI / ML research, app development, robotics, tennis, trading & technical analysis","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8669bfb9-9749-4f24-ab42-3602709f6fb6","session_id":"fe41fb4b-5221-41ce-afce-6a9fa3dade0c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"27642e0f-a981-4143-aea0-6f4f8cb34d37","version":"2.1.226","gitBranch":"main","slug":"structured-meandering-origami"}
