{"parentUuid":"62991066-f642-48d5-955d-a6b3e7b429d0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce7Pjkam6HZRbdtEYMjxi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**SPCC start date: January 2026** — matches what your resume already says.\n\nFrom the transcript: the earliest dated records are **01/29/2026** (the MAT 003/010/021/043/052/071 transition and placement entries, all 0.00 credit hours), with ENG entries following on 02/05/26. Your first *graded* term is **2026SP, running 03/16/26–05/11/26** — ACC 120, BUS 137, CIS 110, all A's, 4.0.\n\nSo \"Jan 2026\" is right if you're dating from enrollment, and \"Mar 2026\" if you're dating from first credit-bearing coursework. Enrollment is the normal convention, so leave it.\n\n---\n\nOn the resume: **4 bullets, back to 3 pages** (my first pass ran to 4 — bullets were too long, so I tightened them). Entire role still sits on page 1.\n\n> Authored **entire-judge**, an automated project-scoring tool with an integrity lens for unaddressed AI warnings and per-team feedback export; **slated for use at partner MLH hackathons**.\n\n> Shipped the **blame, why, and agent-help** attribution commands in the production Go CLI across **15 merged, reviewed pull requests** with test coverage.\n\nBoth numbers are verified, not estimated. You authored **4 of 4 PRs on entire-judge** — the whole repo is yours — and **15 of your CLI PRs are merged**. For linking in applications, the load-bearing ones are:\n\n- **entire-judge** — #2 (integrity lens), #3 (CLI-awareness scoring + per-team feedback export)\n- **cli** — #1305 (added `blame` and `why`), #1562 (`agent-help`), #1614 (interactive `why` viewer), #1585 (passive agent-help discovery)\n\nYou said the CLI work isn't that big, so I kept that bullet shortest and last. It's still 15 merged PRs into a production Go codebase, which reads as more than you're giving it credit for.\n\nOne tradeoff to flag: adding these two meant dropping the score-collapse bullet (the ranking defect that capped retrieval at 19 of 200 results). That was the most technically impressive single thing in the role. Say the word and I'll fold it into bullet 1 or 2."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":366,"cache_read_input_tokens":297846,"output_tokens":1326,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":366,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1326,"cache_read_input_tokens":297846,"cache_creation_input_tokens":366,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":366},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce7PjNXhzbpCNaWK9UkYn","type":"assistant","uuid":"3042e008-3850-4d76-bcc6-3b9853824f4d","timestamp":"2026-08-17T00:43:00.380Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"fe41fb4b-5221-41ce-afce-6a9fa3dade0c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"27642e0f-a981-4143-aea0-6f4f8cb34d37","version":"2.1.226","gitBranch":"main","slug":"structured-meandering-origami"}
