{"parentUuid":"30efe9b4-503e-4c50-856e-8f3c3bb12155","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce7Pu1TDbbE9kTq5h8rXn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both on Desktop:\n\n```\n/Users/suhaan/Desktop/Suhaan_Thayyil_Resume_v3.docx\n/Users/suhaan/Desktop/Suhaan_Thayyil_Resume_v3.pdf\n```\n\n**Start dates**, from your resume:\n\n- **Caltech** (Research Assistant, Kevin S. Fleisher / Dr. Thompson) — **Jun 2026 – Present**\n- **UC San Diego School of Medicine** (Carter Lab) — **May 2026 – Present**\n\nSo UCSD started first by about a month, though it's listed below Caltech in the Experience section. Your entries currently run Entire (Jun 2026) → Caltech (Jun 2026) → UCSD (May 2026), which breaks reverse-chronological order at the third one. If you want it strictly ordered, UCSD should move above Caltech — or leave it, since all three are concurrent and ongoing, and the current order arguably leads with the strongest."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":672,"cache_read_input_tokens":300752,"output_tokens":331,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":672,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":331,"cache_read_input_tokens":300752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":672,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":672},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce7PtnPf5DzMEkDkrb6r8","type":"assistant","uuid":"be2de5c6-5c9e-408d-8a22-5743b236440a","timestamp":"2026-08-17T00:44:52.606Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"fe41fb4b-5221-41ce-afce-6a9fa3dade0c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"27642e0f-a981-4143-aea0-6f4f8cb34d37","version":"2.1.226","gitBranc