{"parentUuid":"35ffe632-104a-40a6-9f4f-17258199e53f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce7QN7c4VT1FLZ7vEL84J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your Greenhouse tabs aren't reachable — Claude in Chrome only controls tabs inside its own tab group, and that group currently holds one blank tab. I can't see or read the applications you have open.\n\n**To give me access**, click the Claude extension icon while you're on each Greenhouse tab (that adds it to the group). Then say go, and I'll re-scan.\n\n**Or** paste the job URLs and I'll open them fresh — but that loses whatever you've already filled in, including the completed first page I'd be copying from.\n\nWhile you sort that out, here's what I'll need to do the work properly, since the statements have to differ by role:\n\n**Which xAI roles are they?** The statement for an infra/systems role should lead with different evidence than one for a research or product role. From your background the natural pitches are:\n\n- *Research / eval-flavored roles* → the LoCoMo comparison: eight systems, shared answerer and judge, and the reader×judge factorial that showed your own headline result reverses. That last part is the strongest thing you have — most applicants don't run the experiment that can kill their result.\n- *Infra / tooling roles* → the harness itself: adapters for eight systems, the metering proxy validated against a vendor's own instrumentation, plus 15 merged PRs into a production Go CLI.\n- *Anything ML/applied* → the two first-author papers, one in round 2 at BMC AI with a Dana-Farber appraisal.\n\nTwo things I want to flag before I type anything into a live application:\n\n**I'll fill, not submit.** Every field gets populated and left for your review; you press submit.\n\n**I won't touch identity or eligibility fields** — SSN, date of birth, work authorization, demographic/EEO questions, or anything requiring a signature. Those are yours to answer, and a wrong value there is worse than a blank one."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":525,"cache_read_input_tokens":306928,"output_tokens":1712,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":525,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1712,"cache_read_input_tokens":306928,"cache_creation_input_tokens":525,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":525},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce7QMyWeEvdZ4doxzW3KM","attributionMcpServer":"claude-in-chrome","attributionMcpTool":"tabs_context_mcp","type":"assistant","uuid":"42bf794e-f53f-4ad9-86e6-6019c12cf651","timestamp":"2026-08-17T00:51:27.258Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"fe41fb4b-5221-41ce-afce-6a9fa3dade0c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"27642e0f-a981-4143-aea0-6f4f8cb34d37","version":"2.1.226","gitBranch":"main","slug":"structured-meandering-origami"}
