{"parentUuid":"e26d73ea-9c3d-4dc6-b040-cbfd33fe51b6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"1","subject":"Decide #82↔#84 merge order + schema-bump question","description":"Workflow wf_8b9d1d00-a24 investigating: PR84 scope/results, PR82 head live-repro of #sig ID churn, pinned-symbol-ID sweep (cmm/entire-brain/p0p1), agentGuide gap. On completion: synthesize, post decision in AGENT-COMMS.md (which PR lands first; whether ID contract must be held / schema-version bump needed before #82 merges).","activeForm":"Deciding #82↔#84 merge order","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"2","subject":"Adversarially verify PR #84 prose-memory/LOCOMO numbers before merge","description":"DONE 2026-08-07 (wf_0bc841c9-645, offline $0): arithmetic ALL_CONFIRMED 8/8 bit-for-bit; integrity ISSUES_FOUND — cmm null arm (24-byte empty context all 1050 cells), full set 10% tune-overlapped (quote holdout 0.756/0.900 beside full), holdout scored 4x across lineage, config.json provenance incomplete. Entire-vs-Graphify +0.1648 [0.1034,0.2146] survives fairness audit. Merge conditions in MemoryNotes §4.","activeForm":"Verifying PR #84 LOCOMO numbers","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"3","subject":"Guard shipped agentGuide const (internal/cli/agents.go)","description":"DONE: PR #87 (test/agent-guide-const-parity, commit 01529ca) — checkGuideClaims(t, origin, source) extracted, TestAgentGuideConstMatchesFlagRegistry added. CRITICAL improvement over plan: naive version was VACUOUS (const yields 0 flag claims — it uses indented code blocks, not fences); agent mutation-tested, taught parser indented blocks (guideIndentedCodeRE, no-op for AGENTS.md), const now yields 9 commands + 20 flags and mutations fail. All tests+vet green. Awaiting review/merge.","activeForm":"Guarding shipped agentGuide","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"4","subject":"Restore gcloud auth for graphbench-c access","description":"RESO