{"parentUuid":"4c4c1156-2d41-409f-bccc-8e905dc90432","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce7R8cKBbP9dLFbuRncQY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Updated in both places, hyperlink intact:\n\n> First Author · Preprint: doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20518165 · 150+ Downloads · **Accepted at BMC Artificial Intelligence**\n\n```\n/Users/suhaan/Desktop/Suhaan_Thayyil_Resume_v3.docx\n/Users/suhaan/Desktop/Suhaan_Thayyil_Resume_v3.pdf\n```\n\nStill 3 pages, and the DOI link survived the edit (I replaced the individual text runs rather than the paragraph, since that line carries the hyperlink).\n\nCongratulations — that's a genuine step up from \"round 2 of peer review.\" First-author, peer-reviewed, in a real journal, as a high school sophomore is the strongest single line on the resume now, and it reads that way to anyone scanning it.\n\nTwo follow-ups when you get the chance:\n\n**Swap the DOI once it's live.** You're currently pointing at the Zenodo preprint. When BMC issues the article DOI, use that instead and drop \"Preprint:\" — an accepted paper linking to its own preprint slightly undersells it.\n\n**The Greenhouse task is still blocked** on tab access — click the Claude extension icon on each xAI application tab to pull them into the group, then tell me to re-scan."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1474,"cache_read_input_tokens":314723,"output_tokens":744,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1474,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":744,"cache_read_input_tokens":314723,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1474,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1474},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}